VSCode extension API
---------------------
The `host-core` package and every product surface depend on `@types/vscode`
and the `vscode` extension API contract published by Microsoft as part of
Visual Studio Code. VSCode itself is not bundled or redistributed by this
repository; extensions built here run inside a user's own VSCode (or
VSCode-compatible, e.g. Open VSX-served) installation.

